{"meta":{"id":"tt0087363","type":"movie","name":"Gremlins","imdb_id":"tt0087363","description":"Rand (Hoyt Axton) es un viajante que un día regala a su hijo Billy (Zach Galligan) una tierna y extraña criatura, un mogwai. El inocente regalo, sin embargo, será el origen de toda una ola de gamberradas y fechorías en un pequeño pueblo de Estados Unidos. Todo empieza cuando son infringidas, una tras otra, las tres reglas básicas que deben seguirse para cuidar a un mogwai: no darle de comer después de medianoche, no mojarlo y evitar que le dé la luz del sol.","poster":"https://btttr.cc/poster-q/imdb/poster-default/tt0087363.jpg?tag=none&lang=es-MX&rs=IM","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/5UX6M0aEphiW6Xmy5rpYX75glbo.jpg","logo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/fbFJ5SVajGly1kCLdSjOUCM1wAA.png","genres":["Fantasía","Terror","Comedia"],"releaseInfo":"1984","released":"1984-06-08T12:00:00.000Z","status":"Released","runtime":"106 min","imdbRating":"7.3","country":"United States of America","cast":["Zach Galligan","Phoebe Cates","Hoyt Axton","Frances Lee McCain","Corey Feldman","Keye Luke","John Louie","Dick Miller","Jackie Joseph","Polly Holliday","Judge Reinhold","Edward Andrews","Belinda Balaski","Scott Brady","Susan Burgess","Harry Carey Jr.","Donald Elson","Jonathan Banks","Glynn Turman","Chuck Jones","Arnie Moore","Danny Llewelyn","Lois Foraker","Kenny Davis","Nicky Katt","Tracy Wells","John C. Becher","Gwen Willson","Joe Brooks","Jim McKrell"],"director":["Joe Dante"],"writer":["Chris Columbus"],"trailers":[{"source":"XXxC0Geijzs","type":"Trailer","name":"TRAILER gremlins","ytId":"XXxC0Geijzs","lang":"es"},{"source":"PXXZx6skXrw","type":"Trailer","name":"4K Trailer","ytId":"PXXZx6skXrw","lang":"en"},{"source":"GEu13j7hOvQ","type":"Trailer","name":"Modern Trailer","ytId":"GEu13j7hOvQ","lang":"en"},{"source":"26TJGkNzceA","type":"Trailer","name":"Rerelease Trailer","ytId":"26TJGkNzceA","lang":"en"},{"source":"WeNVftiefOE","type":"Trailer","name":"Theatri